*.pyc

# Rendered figures: regenerable from the map JSON, large, and they change
# whenever the renderer does. The maps themselves are deliverables and stay.
# The viewer sidecar belongs to its figure, and the tracked copy of both is the
# published one in docs/assets/.
out/**/*.svg
out/**/*_targets.json
out/**/*.html

